{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/feedback/feedback.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:04.587537Z","id":"379de454b76571ccd4dde45e340a4a7bbca903cc04614faf04c82e9f0b6922f4","body":{"detail":"Chrome binds Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+B to the bookmarks bar and Firefox to the Library; the shell's keydown calls preventDefault, so in the shell that browser key stops working for flagged people. Keys pressed inside the cross-origin artifact frame never reach the shell (web/shell/src/view/keys.ts header), so on an artifact view the shortcut works only with focus in the shell's chrome. The menu (FeedbackMenu.svelte) and the keys sheet show the shortcut either way.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":86},"end":{"line":109},"content_hash":"d91f7aa4dada704e87d209b6a2af8cd97afec173c85b33d2119b6e11aa44dcf8"},"suggested_fix":"If either matters, forward the key from the bridge as `clax:shortcut` does for C (pageKeyAction), or pick a key no browser binds.","summary":"The report shortcut Ctrl+Shift+B (Cmd+Shift+B) takes the browser's own binding while focus is in the shell, and is not heard while focus is in the artifact's frame","tags":["review","feedback-loop","revisit:a flagged person reports the bookmarks bar shortcut lost","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/feedback/feedback.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T16:11:41.991972Z","id":"5fb3737612002719a7db59c9aa55269e99e43ffbf1bf59ce4a58d85b7cd86618","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:81d77e09b","summary":"The report key is now plain F (SHORTCUT in web/shell/src/feedback/feedback.ts), which no browser binds, outside text fields and dialogs; the bridge forwards F pressed in the artifact's frame as it does C (web/bridge/src/channel.ts pageShortcut, web/shell/src/view/keys.ts pageKeyAction, reportKey in web/shell/src/feedback/slot.svelte.ts). Tests: bridge/test/channel.test.ts 'forwards F, the report key...', shell/src/page-shortcut.test.ts 'F pressed in the page starts a report...', shell/src/feedback/feedback.test.ts 'F starts a report...'; //web:unit, //web:e2e_queues and //web:e2e_gesture PASSED.","supersedes":"379de454b76571ccd4dde45e340a4a7bbca903cc04614faf04c82e9f0b6922f4","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
